WEBVTT

00:05:31.545 --> 00:05:35.906
For robogamis, there's no
one fixed shape nor task.

00:05:36.628 --> 00:05:40.928
They can transform into anything,
anywhere, anytime.

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:45.084
So how do you make them?

00:05:45.108 --> 00:05:50.425
The biggest technical challenge
of robogami is keeping them super thin,

00:05:50.449 --> 00:05:51.600
flexible,

00:05:51.624 --> 00:05:53.838
but still remaining functional.

00:05:54.562 --> 00:05:58.374
They're composed of multiple layers
of circuits, motors,

00:05:58.398 --> 00:06:00.816
microcontrollers and sensors,